  question: "V\xEC sao l\u1EA1i x\xE2y nh\xE0 cao t\u1EA7ng ?"
  level: "Kh\xF3"
  answer:
  - "V\xEC \u0111\u1EC3 x\u1EED l\xFD v\u1EA5n \u0111\u1EC1 qu\xE1 t\u1EA3i d\xE2n
